    "The target has the additional hypothesis (depth(t)+1)u<1; the natural depth plus one is interpreted as a real in multiplication. Together with u\u22650 it gives a positive denominator and nonnegative bound \u03b3(depth(t)+1,u). The supplied \u03b3 definition has domain \u2115\u00d7\u211d and formula ku/(1-ku); the target only uses it under the strict hypothesis.",
